  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/IMG_1231.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La vesprada d&#39;aquest divendres ha comen&ccedil;at el II Festival Onda, 3 cultures, que</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/IMG_1262.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>enguany du aparellada la I Fira d&#39;Art emergent per tot el centre hist&ograve;ric.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/IMG_1253.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Druida Bar&amp;Drinks, al carrer d&#39;Ausi&agrave;s March, 45, s&#39;ha sumat a l&#39;esdeveniment amb l&#39;elaboraci&oacute; de dos c&ograve;ctels.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendres3culturesfiraartemergent/dinarfiraartemergent.jpg\" alt=\"dinarfiraartemergent\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendres3culturesfiraartemergent/img_1100.jpg\" alt=\"img_1100\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendres3culturesfiraartemergent/img_1101.jpg\" alt=\"img_1101\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendres3culturesfiraartemergent/img_1102.jpg\" alt=\"img_1102\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendres3culturesfiraartemergent/img_1104.jpg\" alt=\"img_1104\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendres3culturesfiraartemergent/img_1107.jpg\" alt=\"img_1107\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/divendres3